gens.text:
Security tightened, passengers shuffled, placing their possessions onto conveyor belts, as beyond, machines hummed, signaling entry checkpoints;
to proceed, everyone must consent to screening, since safety mandates thorough checks;
a queue stretched, winding between barriers, where travelers stripped off outer layers;
among them stood Officer Vance beside a scanner, his presence authoritative, commanding attention;
nearby, a traveler named Eli was flagged, his belongings spread wide for closer examination;
his bag had raised suspicions, prompting further scrutiny, an additional scan deemed necessary;
instructions echoed, guiding individuals through procedures, each step clear and precise;
behind glass, screens displayed images, revealing contents sealed within personal items;
Eli, now guided aside, presented his credentials, each document inspected, ensuring validity;
beside him, Officer Vance conducted a careful pat-down, confirming compliance, then waved him through.
